{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Chronometer 把全球時區收進一個動畫立體地球之中，適合遙距團隊、經常出差旅遊的人士，以及需要掌握各地日照的攝影愛好者。用戶可旋轉地球或選取 190 多個國家，即時掌握當地時間與日出日落資訊。原價 US $0.99，現於 App Store 限時免費。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460bb-75-170.webp\">\n<h2>全球時區即時掌握</h2>\n<p>Chronometer 以動畫立體地球呈現世界時間，選取 190 多個國家後即可查看當地時間、日出日落與黃金時刻，並顯示各地營業時間狀態。收藏面板提供時間對照時間軸，會議規劃可找出重疊辦公時段，時間轉換器亦會標示日期差異。深色玻璃質感介面配備流暢動畫與觸感回饋，適合遙距團隊、旅客及攝影愛好者。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-739-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-740-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-741-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-742-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-743-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-744-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Chronometer : World Clock</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:53.409986+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T00:42:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T01:37:37.644162+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:40.001926+00:00","content_hash":"3a1e471399595b080a2cc6003301646cd2d1d8da6dba653a739568d1ef61f924","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}